<title>THAILAND: Thai Petrochemical plans debentures issue.</title>
<headline>Thai Petrochemical plans debentures issue.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai Petrochemical Industry Plc said on Wednesday that it planned to issue 10-year debentures valued at up to $300 million or its equivalent in foreign currencies.</p>
<p>The debentures would be issued in overseas markets, the company said in a filing with the Thai stock exchange.</p>
<p>Other terms and conditions of the isssue would be considered by the company's board of directors later, it said.</p>
</text>
